===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|uncountable}} The art of producing an [[image]] from a metal plate into which an image or text has been [[etch]]ed with acid.
#: {{hypernyms|en|intaglio}}
#: {{hyponyms|en|aquatint|mezzotint}}
#: {{coordinate terms|en|engraving}}
# {{lb|en|countable}} The image created by this process.
#* {{RQ:Chambers Younger Set|VIII|passage="My tastes," he said, still smiling, "incline me to the garishly sunlit side of this planet." And, to tease her and arouse her to combat: "I prefer a farandole to a nocturne; I'd rather have a painting than an '''etching'''; Mr. Whistler bores me with his monochromatic mud; I don't like dull colours, dull sounds, dull intellects;{{nb...}}."}}

